.TH "nvme_init_clear_export_nvm_res" 9 "nvme_init_clear_export_nvm_res" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_clear_export_nvm_res \- Initialize passthru command for Clear Exported NVM Resource Configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_clear_export_nvm_res
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Clear Exported NVM
Resource Configuration command. All command specific fields are
reserved.
